<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000F0i5G&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1511405880000" alt="Right click on the image to save it to your computer."></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Hi</font><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">I have attempted to contact you today as our records indicate that you are the relevant person to speak to in terms of business travel for <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);">XXXXXX</span>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">We would like to have a better understanding of your travel patterns and requirements; to ensure we’re offering you the most appropriate Qantas product and services which will benefit your company with the greatest savings and benefits. Can you confirm if you are the best person to speak to about this for your business?</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">My phone call would take 5-10 minutes and I am happy to work around a time that is best suited for you over the coming weeks. Please reach out if you would like to see if Qantas can offer further business savings.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="" color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Kindest regards,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="" color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Qantas Corporate Sales</span></div><div style=""><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</font></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">P.&nbsp; 13 10 85 Ext 36</font></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">E.&nbsp; <a href="mailto:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au"><font color="#666666">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</font></a></font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000F0i5L&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1511405880000" alt="Right click on the image to save it to your computer."></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:silver;layout-grid-mode:line">Qantas Privacy Notice<br>
</span></b><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:silver">Qantas collects information about you (including health
information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process
your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs
of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market
research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide
the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its
related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations
which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf,
various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security,
customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy
Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds
about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></p></div></font></div>]]></td>
